}+4{y}^{2}-10\\cdot 0-32y+54 & =0 \\\\ 4{y}^{2}-32y+54 & =0 \\\\ 4[{y}^{2}-8y]+54 & =0 \\\\ 4[(y-4)^{2}-16]+54 & =0 \\\\ 4(y-4)^{2}-64+54 & =0 \\\\ 4(y-4)^{2}-10 & =0 \\\\ 4(y-4)^{2} & =10 \\\\ (y-4)^{2} & =\\frac{10}{4} \\\\ y-4 & =\\pm \\frac{\\sqrt{10}}{2} \\\\ y & =4\\pm \\frac{\\sqrt{10}}{2}\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nTherefore, from top to bottom, the $y$-intercepts are\n\n$$\nA(0,4+\\frac{\\sqrt{10}}{2})\\,\\text{and}\\,B(0,4-\\frac{\\sqrt{10}}{2}).\n$$" 13194139533947 true] [17592186267906 1000 #edb/ref 17592186267907 13194139533947 true] [17592186267906 1040 #edb/ref 17592186045449 13194139533947 true] [17592186267906 1041 "field-1" 13194139533947 true] [17592186267906 1104 #edb/ref 17592186267907 13194139533947 true] [17592186267906 1110 #uuid "55d3a3e0-64e0-5c6f-9933-31ed75050903" 13194139533947 true] [17592186267907 1034 "0" 13194139533947 true] [17592186267907 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139533947 true] [17592186267907 1111 #uuid "030c1d50-b0c4-540b-b069-c27f8d8ba509" 13194139533947 true] [17592186267908 1000 #edb/ref 17592186267909 13194139533947 true] [17592186267908 1040 #edb/ref 17592186045449 13194139533947 true] [17592186267908 1041 "field-2" 13194139533947 true] [17592186267908 1104 #edb/ref 17592186267909 13194139533947 true] [17592186267908 1110 #uuid "dd7af845-2aff-51a0-a3f1-a1945da83997" 13194139533947 true] [17592186267909 1034 "4+\\frac{1}{2}\\sqrt{10}" 13194139533947 true] [17592186267909 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139533947 true] [17592186267909 1111 #uuid "2fb58b5d-2122-500e-a810-9489dfb9887f" 13194139533947 true] [17592186267910 1000 #edb/ref 17592186267911 13194139533947 true] [17592186267910 1040 #edb/ref 17592186045449 13194139533947 true] [17592186267910 1041 "field-3" 13194139533947 true] [17592186267910 1104 #edb/ref 17592186267911 13194139533947 true] [17592186267910 1110 #uuid "83386bc0-5376-5dd6-8a06-92d4f8f1efe5" 13194139533947 true] [17592186267911 1034 "0" 13194139533947 true] [17592186267911 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045